abstract: >-
  Computational and provenance infrastructure of the GRUT research program:
  frozen pre-registration charters, executable instruments, sha-hashed result
  artifacts, verdicts, and formalizations. It is released with the program's
  public record at source boundary master-w25bu9 @ 6abbf316 (25 September
  2026). This is an in-house record: no external peer review, no experimental
  validation, and no confirmed novel quantitative prediction is claimed.
